###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - All errors (geometry error, energy error, test RMSE versus training-domain size and observation set) are plotted only (Figs. 4-14); no values are stated in the text. The 50-configuration test sets therefore carry no result.
# - ACE basis parameters are taken from Ref. 1, Sec. 7.5, and not restated. One run per system stands for the family of models over training-domain sizes and loss variants (no elasticity, CLE, CLE+nonlinear).
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/wang2024.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
